 ## Returns sheet
 
-The volunteer on the returns desk prints the sheet for everything that has come back, one line per hire.
+The volunteer on the returns desk prints the sheet for everything that has come back, one line per hire, with the late fee and what to refund.
+
+## Late returns
+
+Anything that comes back after its due date is charged £1.50 for every day late. Every calendar day counts, Sundays and bank holidays included: the hall letterbox is always open. The fee comes out of the deposit and the rest is refunded. We never take more than the hirer left with us, so the most anyone can lose is their deposit.
+
+The returns desk never waives a fee. Waivers are for the committee to decide at its monthly meeting, and the treasurer refunds them afterwards.
 
